  "final_span": "At the heart of the Dublin Veterans Memorial Auditorium. The joy and play are available to children entering from Hilderbrand Park.\nThe concert at 6 p.m. Monday is at the Village Green in Historic Dublin, followed by another concert at 7 p.m. at the Sycamore Park Amphitheater on North High Street and River Road. Access is free and everyone is welcome; the event will feature performing artists from local, regional, and national communities, along with representatives from Dublin and Worthington.\nAt 10 p.m., fireworks start at the Sycamore Park Amphitheater. The fireworks align with sound from the country and big-band radio station Q106 (and can be heard at 105.7 FM, Q105.7 FM and Q106.com online) from the west side podium.\nThere\u2019s no better place",
